# Go tooling requires LF; keep the tree LF on every platform.
# (The repo was hitting global core.autocrlf=true on Windows, which
# checked out CRLF and made gofmt flag every file.)
*.go text eol=lf
go.mod text eol=lf
go.sum text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
# The world editor's map files are compared byte for byte (d2mapedit's
# round-trip tests; BUG-106): a CRLF checkout on the Windows CI runner
# made every one fail at byte 1. Keep them LF everywhere.
*.tmj text eol=lf
*.tsj text eol=lf

# Binary assets stay untouched
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.zip binary
